{"id":"par","lemma":"par","pos":"noun","rank":353,"glosses":["pair (two of the same or similar items that go together)","couple (two of the same or similar items)","two equal non-collinear forces; that is a force couple in Newtonian mechanics"],"ipa":"/ˈpaɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pares"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-par.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tengo un par de zapatos.","en":"I have a pair of shoes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458986","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"shoe","l":"zapato"}]},{"text":"¿Podría dormir un par de horas?","en":"Could I get a few hours of sleep?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/578251","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to sleep"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"hour","l":"hora"}]},{"text":"Estuve allá un par de veces.","en":"I've been there a couple of times.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589982","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"by, times"}]},{"text":"Necesito un par de días más.","en":"I need a few more days.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460570","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null,{"g":"more"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"a few days old"]]},{"text":"¿Puedo hacer un par de preguntas?","en":"May I ask a few questions?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538125","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"question","l":"pregunta"}]}]}